### ======================================
### Smoke Test - 冒烟测试（5分钟快速验证）
### Author: OpenCode
### Version: v1.1
### Expected: 所有接口返回 code=200
### ======================================

### 1. 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 2. 当前用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. Dashboard 摘要
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. 商品列表
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "page": 1,
  "size": 5
}


### 5. 库存列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. 角色列表（验证 RBAC 权限正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. AI 报告历史（验证 AI 模块加载正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 8. 无 Token 访问 → 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roles


### --- Smoke Test 结束 ---
### 如果以上全部返回 code=200（末条为 401），系统通过冒烟测试。
